<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Trade, final inflation.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Trade, final inflation.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR     PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					   DATA		   DATE</p>
<p> Foreign trade     June     May 9.5 bln DM surplus   Sept 10</p>
<p>Inflation, final   Aug	-0.1 m/m, +1.4 y/y	 Sept 10-11</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets. The previous CPI inflation figures were preliminary data for west Germany alone.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
